===Etymology===
{{bor+|sv|ru|-}}, as evidenced by the spelling of the word reflecting the {{transliteration|sv|ru|Азербайджан|nocap=1}}; the Russian {{m|ru|ж}} is transliterated as ⟨zj⟩ in Swedish. From {{der|sv|az|Azərbaycan}}, ultimately from {{der|sv|grc|Ἀτροπατηνή}}. See {{m+|en|Azerbaijan}} for more.

